  "priorExpiration": "1998-04-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1203.03 Request for Extension of Certificate Inspection Period.\n\n(a) Under RSA 157-A: 8, II (h), an owner as defined in RSA 157-A: 2, I who requests an extension of the period of time beyond the expiration of the grace period, under RSA 157-A: 8, II (g), shall make such request in writing to the commissioner prior to the expiration of the grace period.\n\n(b) The request, made pursuant to (a), above, shall include the specific reason for the request and the specific length of time requested.\n\n(c) The request shall include a written statement by the current inspector who is authorized to inspect the boilers and/or pressure vessels and who holds a current license issued by the commissioner under RSA 157-A: 7.\n\n(d) The written statement by the inspector provided in accordance with (c), above, shall certify that the length of time requested will not jeopardize the safety of the general public.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lab 1200) #5371, eff 4-10-92, EXPIRED: 4-10-98\n\nNew. #7210, eff 2-28-00; ss by #9076, eff 1-24-08; ss by #11071, eff 4-11-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab1200.html"
